<section className="faqs bg-aurora">
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-1"></div>
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-2"></div>
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-3"></div>
        <h2>Machine Learning Diploma <span className="cc-highlight">FAQs</span></h2>
        <p className="faqDetails">Short answers to common questions about the course, AI careers and what you build during training.</p>
        <div className="faq-grid">
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What is the Diploma in Machine Learning?</summary>
                    <p>It is our 12-month, 288-hour programme covering Python, statistics, classical ML, XGBoost, time series, deep learning, computer vision, NLP, transformers, Gen AI and MLOps, with 15+ projects.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>How is the Diploma different from the 6-month Advanced ML course?</summary>
                    <p>The Advanced course covers the core ML stack in 6 months. This 12 month machine learning course adds time series forecasting, advanced NLP with transformers, more computer vision, cloud MLOps and 15+ projects.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Do I need coding or maths background?</summary>
                    <p>No. Python and the maths you need are taught from zero in the first modules.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Where is the machine learning diploma in Delhi held, and is there an online option?</summary>
                    <p>Classroom batches run at our Greater Kailash II campus in South Delhi. You can also join the online diploma in machine learning with the same live classes, labs and placement support.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Is Gen AI part of this AI and ML diploma?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. This is an AI and ML diploma with Gen AI built in: AI tools are used in every module, and a dedicated module covers LLMs, LangChain basics and Gen AI for marketing and business.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Are computer vision and NLP covered?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. Full modules cover both, so it also works as a computer vision and NLP course: CNNs, OpenCV and YOLO, plus NLP, BERT, GPT and Hugging Face.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Is time series forecasting included?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. A dedicated time series forecasting course module covers ARIMA, Prophet and ML forecasting for sales and demand.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Which tools will I learn?</summary>
                    <p>Python, Jupyter, Colab, Git, Pandas, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow, Keras, PyTorch, OpenCV, YOLO, Hugging Face, LangChain, FastAPI, Docker, MLflow and AWS.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What projects will I build?</summary>
                    <p>More than 15 projects across classical ML, forecasting, deep learning, computer vision, NLP, Gen AI and deployment, all on your GitHub.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What certificates will I get?</summary>
                    <p>The DizitalAdda Diploma in Machine Learning and AI, Skill India recognition and module certificates for ML, deep learning, NLP, computer vision and MLOps.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What jobs can I get after the diploma?</summary>
                    <p>Machine Learning Engineer, AI Engineer, Data Scientist, NLP Engineer, Computer Vision Engineer and MLOps Engineer.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Do you provide placement support?</summary>
                    <p>Yes, this machine learning diploma with placement support includes GitHub review, technical ML mock interviews and referrals through our 250+ hiring partners.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What are the batch timings?</summary>
                    <p>Morning, afternoon, evening and weekend batches are available, online and in the classroom. New batches start every 2 to 3 weeks and classes are recorded.</p>
                </details>
                    </div>
    </section>


    
